# python-cv profile — computer vision on uploaded media (CPU-only; there is
# no GPU passthrough in Firecracker). ffmpeg handles video decode/frame
# extraction; opencv/numpy/pillow do the analysis. tesseract + pytesseract
# add OCR so the agent can transcribe text visible in frames. Installed via
# apt so the heavy wheels are prebuilt against the image's glibc.
git
build-essential
curl
ffmpeg
python3-opencv
python3-numpy
python3-pil
python3-scipy
tesseract-ocr
python3-pytesseract